山峦如黛，天空湛蓝如洗，几朵白云悠然游弋，营造出空灵开阔的意境。构图采用中景特写，人物居画面中央偏左，留出右侧空间以延展草原的辽阔感，形成视觉平衡。光线为自然日光，从左上方斜射，柔和地勾勒出她身体的轮廓与裙摆的褶皱，阴影轻盈而不刺眼，赋予画面温暖而宁静的氛围。\n\n整幅画面弥漫着清新自然、青春自由的气息，仿佛能听见风穿过草叶的轻响，感受到阳光洒在皮肤上的暖意。色彩对比鲜明又和谐——红与白的碰撞充满活力，绿意盎然的背景则衬托出人物的纯净与灵动。画面质感细腻，光影层次丰富，既具日常摄影的真实感，又带有AI生成图像特有的柔和与理想化美感，宛如一幅被阳光吻过的夏日田园诗画，唤起观者对自由、自然与青春的美好向往。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 395, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 258, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [497, 506], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [263.91729736328125, 50.14513397216797], "pos": [1242.2501220703125, 904.8790283203125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 394, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 257, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 26}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [3699.270326725861, 1527.9580090690636], "scale": 0.17349448024328973}}, "groups": [], "links": [[128, 3, 0, 8, 0, "LATENT"], [163, 77, 0, 3, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [170, 88, 0, 3, 3, "LATENT"], [207, 110, 0, 3, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [379, 78, 0, 243, 0, "IMAGE"], [388, 264, 0, 252, 0, "IMAGE"], [394, 261, 0, 257, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [395, 271, 0, 258, 0, "*"], [397, 258, 0, 259, 1, "STRING"], [428, 169, 0, 3, 0, "MODEL"], [434, 8, 0, 285, 0, "*"], [495, 24